{"content_hash": "826a9f1f9de9f509", "version_id": 993, "article_id": 100, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Beats and Pokémon team up on a special Pill speaker that sells out fast", "title_zh": "Beats 和宝可梦联名出特别版音箱，很快就卖断货了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84293", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610366398516-46da9dec5931?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YmVhdHMlMjBkZXNrJTIwc2V0dXB8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDg4ODI4OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Amr Taha™ on Unsplash", "author": "Amr Taha™", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@amr_taha?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-flat-screen-computer-monitor-on-brown-wooden-desk-SMMqej67qjI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(350, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(28, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "40a674dce8b1"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-17", "word_count": 203, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Beats has released a special Pokémon edition of its Pill speaker, and it sold out quickly. The design goes far beyond a simple logo swap, with Pikachu, Mimikyu and even a hanging charm.", "lead_zh": "Beats 推出了宝可梦特别版的 Pill 音箱，很快就卖断货了。这次的设计远不止换个标志那么简单，有皮卡丘、谜拟丘，甚至还配了一个挂饰。", "preview": "The special edition went on sale on October 13, only on Apple's online store and Beats' Douyin shop. It sold out soon after, so it is now ha", "preview_zh": "这款特别版在 10 月 13 日开卖，只在苹果官网商店和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，所以现在很难用原价买到。虽然 Beats 经常和其他品牌联名，但这次合作比大多数都更用心。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 976, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 66.15, "size_bytes": 397872, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 228, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 67.7, "size_bytes": 407088, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 228, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 72.325, "size_bytes": 434880, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 228, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 62.3, "size_bytes": 374688, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 228, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 67.3, "size_bytes": 404784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 228, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/993.json", "paragraphs": ["The special edition went on sale on October 13, only on Apple's online store and Beats' Douyin shop. It sold out soon after, so it is now hard to find at the normal price. Although Beats often works with other brands, this partnership is more detailed than most.", "The design starts with the packaging, which shows Pikachu on one side and Mimikyu on the other. You can fold up their ears to turn the box into a stand, which is a new idea for Beats. Inside, the speaker's front grille shows both characters with metal lightning bolts.", "Beats also added a strap with a charm for the first time, and the charm shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. The speaker keeps its soft silicone body and IP67 dust and water protection, so you can use it in the bathroom or outdoors.", "The sound is strong, with deep bass and clear highs, and one charge lasts up to 24 hours. You can pair two speakers for stereo sound or use a USB-C cable for lossless audio. The special edition costs the same as the normal one, although resellers now ask two or three times the price."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款特别版在 10 月 13 日开卖，只在苹果官网商店和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，所以现在很难用原价买到。虽然 Beats 经常和其他品牌联名，但这次合作比大多数都更用心。", "设计从包装就开始了，一面是皮卡丘，另一面是谜拟丘。你可以把它们的耳朵翻起来，把盒子变成立牌，这对 Beats 来说是个新点子。打开后，音箱正面网罩上有这两个角色，还嵌着金属质感的闪电。", "Beats 还第一次给 Pill 配了挂绳和挂饰，挂饰一面是精灵球，另一面是 Beats 的标志。音箱保留了柔软的硅胶机身和 IP67 防尘防水，所以浴室或户外都能用。", "它的声音很有力，低音浑厚，高音清晰，充满电能用 24 小时。两台音箱可以配对组成立体声，也能用 USB-C 线播放无损音频。特别版和普通版价格一样，不过现在代购要价已经翻了两三倍。"], "body": "The special edition went on sale on October 13, only on Apple's online store and Beats' Douyin shop. It sold out soon after, so it is now hard to find at the normal price. Although Beats often works with other brands, this partnership is more detailed than most.\n\nThe design starts with the packaging, which shows Pikachu on one side and Mimikyu on the other. You can fold up their ears to turn the box into a stand, which is a new idea for Beats. Inside, the speaker's front grille shows both characters with metal lightning bolts.\n\nBeats also added a strap with a charm for the first time, and the charm shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. The speaker keeps its soft silicone body and IP67 dust and water protection, so you can use it in the bathroom or outdoors.\n\nThe sound is strong, with deep bass and clear highs, and one charge lasts up to 24 hours. You can pair two speakers for stereo sound or use a USB-C cable for lossless audio. The special edition costs the same as the normal one, although resellers now ask two or three times the price.", "body_zh": "这款特别版在 10 月 13 日开卖，只在苹果官网商店和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，所以现在很难用原价买到。虽然 Beats 经常和其他品牌联名，但这次合作比大多数都更用心。\n\n设计从包装就开始了，一面是皮卡丘，另一面是谜拟丘。你可以把它们的耳朵翻起来，把盒子变成立牌，这对 Beats 来说是个新点子。打开后，音箱正面网罩上有这两个角色，还嵌着金属质感的闪电。\n\nBeats 还第一次给 Pill 配了挂绳和挂饰，挂饰一面是精灵球，另一面是 Beats 的标志。音箱保留了柔软的硅胶机身和 IP67 防尘防水，所以浴室或户外都能用。\n\n它的声音很有力，低音浑厚，高音清晰，充满电能用 24 小时。两台音箱可以配对组成立体声，也能用 USB-C 线播放无损音频。特别版和普通版价格一样，不过现在代购要价已经翻了两三倍。", "text": "The special edition went on sale on October 13, only on Apple's online store and Beats' Douyin shop. It sold out soon after, so it is now hard to find at the normal price. Although Beats often works with other brands, this partnership is more detailed than most. The design starts with the packaging, which shows Pikachu on one side and Mimikyu on the other. You can fold up their ears to turn the box into a stand, which is a new idea for Beats. Inside, the speaker's front grille shows both characters with metal lightning bolts. Beats also added a strap with a charm for the first time, and the charm shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. The speaker keeps its soft silicone body and IP67 dust and water protection, so you can use it in the bathroom or outdoors. The sound is strong, with deep bass and clear highs, and one charge lasts up to 24 hours. You can pair two speakers for stereo sound or use a USB-C cable for lossless audio. The special edition costs the same as the normal one, although resellers now ask two or three times the price.", "vocab": [{"word": "special edition", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "特别版", "note": "指为特别活动或合作推出的版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sell out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "售罄", "note": "常用被动或主动形式，如 it sold out", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "partnership", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合作；联名", "note": "比 cooperation 更强调双方共同参与", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "packaging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "包装", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "grille", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（音箱的）网罩", "note": "指扬声器前面的网状部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charm", "pos": "noun", "zh": "挂饰；小饰物", "note": "常挂在绳子或包上", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "protection", "pos": "noun", "zh": "防护", "note": "IP67 protection 指防尘防水等级", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bass", "pos": "noun", "zh": "低音", "note": "音乐中的低频声音", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reseller", "pos": "noun", "zh": "转卖者；代购", "note": "指买下商品再高价卖出的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "although", "pos": "conj", "zh": "虽然；尽管", "note": "引导让步状语从句，后面接完整句子", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T04:04:45.682211", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "special", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.7, "sm": 325, "em": 699, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "edition", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.125, "sm": 700, "em": 1125, "cs": 12, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "went", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.288, "sm": 1125, "em": 1287, "cs": 20, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "on", "s": 1.288, "e": 1.487, "sm": 1287, "em": 1487, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "sale", "s": 1.488, "e": 1.85, "sm": 1487, "em": 1850, "cs": 28, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "on", "s": 1.85, "e": 2.0, "sm": 1850, "em": 1999, "cs": 33, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "October", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.45, "sm": 2000, "em": 2450, "cs": 36, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "13", "s": 2.45, "e": 3.125, "sm": 2450, "em": 3124, "cs": 44, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ",", "s": 3.125, "e": 3.25, "sm": 3125, "em": 3250, "cs": 46, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "only", "s": 3.25, "e": 3.538, "sm": 3250, "em": 3537, "cs": 48, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "on", "s": 3.538, "e": 3.712, "sm": 3537, "em": 3712, "cs": 53, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "Apple's", "s": 3.712, "e": 4.1, "sm": 3712, "em": 4099, "cs": 56, "ce": 63, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "online", "s": 4.1, "e": 4.562, "sm": 4100, "em": 4562, "cs": 64, "ce": 70, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w":